Description: Collects worldwide daily weather and soil data, derives
    agro-meteorological parameters, builds environmental covariable matrices and
    relatedness kernels, mines environmental typologies, delineates soil zones
    with Gaussian mixture models, and runs a FAO-56 soil water balance for use in
    enviromics and genotype-by-environment analyses.
